WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
- You were talking about the
"Royal Rumble" coming up.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.950
So explain that to everybody
who doesn't know what that is?

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.350
- So the "Royal Rumble",
it's a, it's a PLE of ours.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.810
It's one of the biggest ones of the year.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.220
It's one of our favorite ones.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.053
- Yes.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.400
- It jump starts the
road to "WrestleMania".

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.233
- [Montez] Yes.

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:15.840
- [Bianca] So it's unpredictable.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.820
I, I always like to
describe it as a mixture

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.231
between the past, the
present, and the future.

00:00:19.231 --> 00:00:22.080
And what it is, is 30 women in one ring.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.750
It starts out with two
women in every two minutes

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.610
or so, another woman comes out

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.080
and no one knows who it's going to be.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.251
So it's very...

00:00:30.251 --> 00:00:31.084
- [Kelly] Oh, I like that.

00:00:31.084 --> 00:00:31.917
- Unpredictable.

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:33.090
It can be a legend, someone from the past.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.560
It can be a current superstar.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:35.880
It could be one of the women from one

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.666
of the developmental programs
that's considered the future.

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:39.930
- It could be Kelly
Clarkson. - [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.400
- [Bianca] It could be anyone, exactly.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.600
- You don't want me in that ring.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.440
- [Bianca] It could be anyone.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:44.659
- I got a lotta inner rage.

00:00:44.659 --> 00:00:47.592
(audience laughing)

00:00:47.592 --> 00:00:49.358
You don't want, you
don't wanna unleash this.

00:00:49.358 --> 00:00:51.030
You gotta harness it in music.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:51.863
- There you go.

00:00:51.863 --> 00:00:53.490
Might see Kelly Clarkson
at the "Royal Rumble".

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.770
But the way to eliminate someone,

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.360
you throw them over the top rope.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.580
So you, you're trying to throw
people over the top rope.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.080
People are trying to throw
you over the top rope

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.692
and the way you win is you're
the last woman standing.

00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:04.525
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:04.525 --> 00:01:05.358
- [Bianca] And if you're
the last woman standing,

00:01:05.358 --> 00:01:08.310
then you get an automatic
title match at "WrestleMania".

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.450
So it's a huge deal.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.290
It's one of my favorites.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:13.530
I actually won the "Royal
Rumble" the year that I got

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:14.730
to main event "WrestleMania".

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.070
So it changed the whole
trajectory of my career.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.480
I won an ESPY off of that match.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.490
So it's an exciting time of the year.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:21.900
It can change someone's career.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.880
It can change their
whole entire trajectory.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.160
It's just an amazing match to watch.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:26.993
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:26.993 --> 00:01:27.826
- Super exciting.

00:01:27.826 --> 00:01:29.000
- I love the drama of
not knowing who's coming.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:29.880
- Yes.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:30.713
- Right.

00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:31.546
- Yeah.

00:01:31.546 --> 00:01:32.379
- For someone who doesn't watch-.

00:01:32.379 --> 00:01:33.907
- Like Christmas dinner, when
people are bringing dates.

00:01:33.907 --> 00:01:34.740
(audience laughing)

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:35.573
- [Montez] Exactly, right?

00:01:35.573 --> 00:01:36.900
- [Kelly] Like, who will it be?

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:37.733
- Who will it be this year?

00:01:37.733 --> 00:01:39.099
- [Kelly] Will they make it?

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.200
(audience and guests laughing)

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.000
- Alright, we have to do
a quick commercial break.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.557
You can see WWE "Royal
Rumble 2024", January 27th,

00:01:45.557 --> 00:01:47.347
exclusively on Peacock

00:01:47.347 --> 00:01:51.488
and also "Love &amp; WWE: Bianca
&amp; Montez" is streaming

00:01:51.488 --> 00:01:54.033
on Hulu from February 2nd.

